></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUKUMOTO, YOSHINORI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAWA, KENJI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A controller having  high-speed gear transiting means for changing the gear to the low gear through a specific high-speed gear, e.g., the second gear when the gear is changed from a non-drive range to a drive range. The gear change mode can be manually switched from an automatic mode in which the gear is changed according to a preset gear change characteristic to a manual mode in which the gear is changed manually by the driver, and vice versa. If the mode is switched to the manual mode while the gear is transitionally the specific high-speed gear brought about by the high-speed gear transiting means, the gear is preferentially changed to the low gear by the high-speed gear means.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un contrôleur possédant un dispositif de transmission à engranges haute vitesse qui permet de passer sur l'engrenage inférieur au moyen d'un engrenage spécifique haute vitesse, par exemple, le second engrenage, lorsque celui-ci passe d'une plage non motrice à une plage motrice. Le mode de changement d'engrenage peut être commuté manuellement d'un mode automatique dans lequel l'engrenage passe, selon une caractéristique présélectionnée de changement d'engrenage, à un mode manuel dans lequel il est changé manuellement par le conducteur, et vice versa. Si le mode est commuté en mode manuel alors que l'engrenage est l'engrenage spécifique haute vitesse entraîné par le dispositif de transmission haute vitesse, l'engrenage passe de préférence sur l'engrenage inférieur par le dispositif de transmission haute vitesse.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>